	(text "RELAY OUTPUT (dry contacts on J12) + HEATER THERMAL-FUSE LOOP (J9)\nJ12 is isolated from the board: use it for a light, or loop it in series with J9\nto get a firmware-controlled heater disconnect. Without that, a shorted triac\nis only stopped by the thermal fuse."
